  "note": "co2 figures are a MODELED ESTIMATE from live position/altitude data and category-average fuel burn rates -- not measured emissions. dark_aircraft_flags is a low-confidence heuristic: ADS-B receiver coverage gaps are far more common than genuine transponder-off events."
}